From 5ae9be4e3c3385eb87ce270fc67eb7dacf378e9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:23:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] Phase 10: real write-side integration for History +
 Likes

- HistoryRepository/LikedRepository: thin wrappers over Phase 9's DAOs,
  take pre-built entities so they stay free of shorts/download imports.
- ShortsViewModel.recordWatch(item): writes a HistoryEntity(SHORT_WATCH).
  ShortsFragment.playAt() calls it right after a Short starts playing.
- ShortsViewModel.toggleLike(): now also upserts/deletes a LikedEntity
  alongside the existing cache-local ShortsCacheEntity.isLiked write,
  connecting Phase 2's flag to Phase 9's durable table.
- DownloadService: shared recordDownloadHistory() helper, called from
  both processHttps() and processBlob() right after DownloadStatus is
  set to COMPLETE, so history covers both entry points.
